# ==============================================================================
# ActionPulse — Root Environment Variables Overview
# ==============================================================================
# Our project has two distinct execution boundaries with separate environment files:
#
# 1. FRONTEND (React + Vite SPA)
#    Location: `frontend/.env` (based on `frontend/.env.example`)
#    - Uses `VITE_` prefix (e.g., `VITE_SUPABASE_URL`, `VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY`)
#    - Bundled into client-side JS. Contains ONLY public/anon keys.
#
# 2. BACKEND (FastAPI / Python 3.11+)
#    Location: `backend/.env` (based on `backend/.env.example`)
#    - Contains server-only secrets (e.g., `SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY`, `GEMINI_API_KEY`, `SMTP_PASS`)
#    - NEVER expose these keys to the frontend or version control!
#
# To get started:
#   cd frontend && cp .env.example .env
#   cd ../backend && cp .env.example .env
# ==============================================================================
